  "sourceCommit": "1398289b4e991666c8fa9de2b9df38f273feb48c",
  "status": "installed",
  "changes": [
    "Ether purchase prices doubled (votes 2/10/20/50/100/200). Package quantities unchanged. Black Friday purchase tokens remain votes ×10 and consequently double; the coupon does not multiply them again.",
    "Actual pet shield grants advance personal/event shield metrics through a durable per-life sequence. Duplicate/stale events and failed saves do not double-credit. Existing clan shield handling remains in place.",
    "Arena view expanded another 5%, bounded by the existing maximum visible world area. Clan level costs and per-level XP accounting unchanged.",
    "Black Friday success footer removed; exchange success is a short nonblocking overlay. Current clan booster artwork also used by event preload. Clan battle explanatory footer removed.",
    "Crest tabs show all their choices in rows. CSS stacked panels reserve the tallest category; switching tabs only toggles visibility. Removed pagination and resize measurement loop. Narrow layouts remain scrollable through normal dialog scrolling."
  ],
